## Results (from the render-inspect pass)

- All 7 pages load (HTTP 200). Headings: no skipped levels on any page.
- Images: every figure img served (HEAD 200), visible images have natural dimensions,
  all carry descriptive alt text matching the figure manifest; lazy loading present;
  the hidden dark twins (display:none per [data-theme]) correctly report natural=0x0
  and are judged by fetch, not paint - none missing.
- Narrow 360px: document horizontal overflow 0px on all 7 pages; both figures per topic
